[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15242.79, "timestamp": "04:14:02", "text": "10. よし、これで1つ目だ。それは服です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15256.309, "timestamp": "04:14:16", "text": "クロ。あぁ、ちょっと物を落とさなきゃ。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15265.51, "timestamp": "04:14:25", "text": "H. はい、どうぞ。詰まってしまいました。何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15267.03, "timestamp": "04:14:27", "text": "私が作れるもの全部？私は作ることができます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15270.03, "timestamp": "04:14:30", "text": "包帯と救急バッグ。それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15272.51, "timestamp": "04:14:32", "text": "私が信じているように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15282.91, "timestamp": "04:14:42", "text": "もの。弓。うん。うん。弓。それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15287.55, "timestamp": "04:14:47", "text": "もの。ええと、武器。弓。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15290.91, "timestamp": "04:14:50", "text": "はい。服を着る。うん。えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15293.07, "timestamp": "04:14:53", "text": "待って。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15296.229, "timestamp": "04:14:56", "text": "クラフト。矢印はどうやって入手するのですか？私はします"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15297.79, "timestamp": "04:14:57", "text": "ない"}]